{
  "description": "The version checks fail closed when the ecosystem has no version order. A range that the ecosystem cannot order is invalid: a block entry with it blocks every version, and a trust entry with it is dropped. A block entry with one version blocks only that version text, so a block on v4 does not block v3.",
  "now": "2026-11-01T12:00:00Z",
  "checks": [
